{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1737694045_3558495_16966b7b20451d471c21673b51db873e.png",
  "description": "<h3 style=\"font-weight: var(--ds-font-weight-strong); font-size: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*16px); line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; white-space: normal;\"><strong>Brand Introduction</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 16.002px; line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height); color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; white-space: normal;\">Phyto Spa is a New Zealand-based skincare brand dedicated to harnessing the power of nature to deliver pure, effective, and sustainable skincare solutions. Our products are crafted with 98-100% natural ingredients, designed to nourish, rejuvenate, and protect your skin. We believe in transparency, sustainability, and the transformative power of nature, making us a trusted choice for conscious consumers worldwide.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-weight: var(--ds-font-weight-strong); font-size: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*16px); line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; white-space: normal;\"><strong>Product Description</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 16.002px; line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height); color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; white-space: normal;\">Our product range includes:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"padding-left: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*24px); color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16.002px; white-space: normal;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Facial Serums</strong>: Lightweight, nutrient-rich formulas to target specific skin concerns like hydration, anti-aging, and brightening.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Moisturizers</strong>: Deeply nourishing creams and lotions made with natural botanicals to restore and protect your skin&rsquo;s barrier.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Cleansers</strong>: Gentle yet effective cleansers that remove impurities without stripping your skin&rsquo;s natural oils.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Body Care</strong>: Luxurious body oils, scrubs, and lotions to pamper your skin from head to toe.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 16.002px; line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height); color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; white-space: normal;\">All our products are free from harsh chemicals, synthetic fragrances, and parabens, making them suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-weight: var(--ds-font-weight-strong); font-size: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*16px); line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; white-space: normal;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"padding-left: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*24px); color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16.002px; white-space: normal;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>98-100% Natural Ingredients</strong>: Our products are formulated with the highest percentage of natural ingredients, ensuring purity and effectiveness.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Transparency</strong>: We clearly list every ingredient, so customers know exactly what they&rsquo;re using.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Sustainability</strong>: From eco-friendly packaging to responsibly sourced ingredients, we&rsquo;re committed to reducing our environmental impact.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Proven Results</strong>: Our products are designed to deliver visible, long-lasting results, backed by glowing customer reviews.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-weight: var(--ds-font-weight-strong); font-size: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*16px); line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; white-space: normal;\"><strong>Payment Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"padding-left: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*24px); color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16.002px; white-space: normal;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Commission Rates</strong>: Starting 15% commission rate tailored to reward high-performing affiliates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Payment Schedule</strong>: Monthly payouts via PayPal or bank transfer.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Cookie Duration</strong>: 30-day cookie window to ensure affiliates are credited for their referrals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-weight: var(--ds-font-weight-strong); font-size: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*16px); line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; white-space: normal;\"><strong>Other Information</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"padding-left: calc(var(--ds-md-zoom)*24px); color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16.002px; white-space: normal;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Affiliate Support</strong>: We provide our affiliates with exclusive marketing materials, including banners, product images, and promotional content.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>Dedicated Account Manager</strong>: Access to a dedicated account manager for personalized support and guidance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: var(--ds-md-font-size); line-height: var(--ds-md-line-height);\"><strong>High Conversion Potential</strong>: Our products appeal to a growing audience of health-conscious consumers seeking natural, effective skincare solutions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
